			"notes": "Fixes\n- Mods built for Deployer 0.1 that add Stock Keeper tabs crashed the game on startup, for example Create: Factory Controller 1.2.4 (`NoSuchMethodError` on `ClientRegisterHelpers.registerStockKeeperTab`)\n\nFor developers\n- The 0.1 Stock Keeper tab API is back as deprecated, to be removed in 2.0: `ClientRegisterHelpers.registerStockKeeperTab(BiFunction)`, the `KeeperTabScreen` and `StockTabScreen` constructors that take a `StockKeeperRequestMenu`, the `KeeperTabScreen.menu` field and `KeeperSourceContext.of(StockTickerBlockEntity)`. Tabs registered with the `BiFunction` only show in the Stock Keeper screen; new code should keep using the 1.0 API"
		},
